 R←Test_API_032(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;tempDir;rc;msg;buff;parms
⍝ Runs "StashPush" with a message. The command used to be built as -m="..." and Git's option
⍝ parser takes everything after the option letter as the value, so every stash was stored with
⍝ a leading "=" in its message.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 tempDir←FilesAndDirs.GetTempSubDir'APLGit2-',⊃⎕SI
 (##.CiderConfig.HOME,'/TestData/CiderProject4.zip')ZipArchive.UnzipTo tempDir
 (⊂' r←Counter' ' r←4711')⎕NPUT(tempDir,'/APLSource/Counter.aplf')1

 parms←G.CreateStashPushParms
 parms.folder←tempDir
 parms.msg←'A message of my own'
 {}G.StashPush parms

 buff←∊G.StashList tempDir
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/': A message of my own'⍷buff
 →T.GoToTidyUp∨/'=A message'⍷buff

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce tempDir
 msg Assert rc=0
⍝Done
